{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一項調查顯示，本港企業今年平均加薪幅度百分之2.3，較去年少0.2個百分點。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SALARY-1100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iCTNjaq3Ka1792644051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>浸會大學聯同華南理工大學等，7至9月期間進行粵港澳大灣區薪酬及福利調查，訪問了221間企業，其中78間是香港企業，兩成三表示今年凍薪，預測明年加薪幅度為百分之3.1。應屆畢業生平均起薪點介乎17,500元至23,000元，當中工程行業的月薪最高，較去年高百分之7。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SALARY-1100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Rk6Eu97hI21792644067.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>至於廣東省九個城市，平均加薪幅度百分之2.2，機構指反映經濟環境有改善。其中從事研發的應屆本科畢業生起薪最高、有7,000元。而澳門企業的薪酬就升幅最低，只有百分之1.1，六成受訪企業都稱凍薪。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:21:51.219928+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:54.457784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:45.884283+00:00","content_hash":"1b75649223c80b89ba0205e26d0dedebba11b39d55bb65412bd44e28ff82c235","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}